// Page TaskOwnerPage Text :
"P3231769607" "<color orange>"Only your team leader may speak to Taskmaster Carlyle."</color>"
// Page CarlyleComplete Text :
"P2560986971" "Go on, take the boy's soul and leave. He's worth a lot of wax, but I'd rather keep my candle flickering than burn out with him in hand."
// Page CarlyleComplete SayOutLoudText :
"P3211222510" "Go on...<t 1>Take the boy's soul and leave.<t 3>Sure, he's worth a lot of wax...<t 2>But I'd rather keep my candle flickering than burn out with him in hand.<t 0.1>"
// Page CarlyleIncomplete Text :
"P2797765097" "Grrr... Outsiders! Always double dealing. Guess I haven't much choice with how you're knockin' wax left and right here. What is it you want? Maybe we can come to a mutually beneficial deal here."
// Page CarlyleIncomplete SayOutLoudText :
"P3100049484" "Grrr... Outsiders!<t 2>Always double dealing.<t 2>Guess I haven't much choice with how you're knockin' wax left and right here.<t 4>What is it you want?<t 2>Maybe we can come to a mutually beneficial deal here.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2357658159" "Percy Winkley, I need his soul."
// Page NegotiatePage1 Text :
"P3822803026" "I should have guessed. Such a fume to that one. What do you have to exchange? He's worth quite a bit to me."
// Page NegotiatePage1 SayOutLoudText :
"P1529050569" "I should have guessed.<t 2>Such a fume to that one.<t 3>What do you have to exchange?<t 2>He's worth quite a bit to me.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2731340644" "Give me Percy and he can help get you back on schedule."
// Answer Text :
"P2096576530" "How about I don't destroy you? Fair trade?"
// Page Peaceful Text :
"P2388819597" "Back on schedule? Then, you know what has happened? Well... One soul is a small price to pay to ship off the lot of these to their destination.<br><br>Why, I'm losing wax every minute this station remains inoperative.<br><br>Alright... I'll give you Percy... But after that you hold up your end of the bargain and fix things, no more, no less."
// Page Peaceful SayOutLoudText :
"P4184845728" "Back on schedule?<t 2>Then, you know what has happened?<t 3> Well...<t 1>One soul is a small price to pay to ship off the lot of these to their destination.<t 5>Why, I'm losing wax every minute this station remains inoperative.<t 5>Alright... I'll give you Percy...<t 2>But after that you hold up your end of the bargain and fix things, no more, no less.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1512970491" "It's a deal!"
