// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P587273529" "Well.<t 1>What've we got here, lads?<t 2>A weezer seekin' to expidite their journey into the great beyond?<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1464381390" "I'd hate to be Carlyle now, guy must be drippin' wax by the bucket by now..."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3630978575" "Hey!<t 1>Heartbeat!<t 2>You don't belong here!!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1677525562" "All I know is that if we can't get these souls movin' soon we'll be out a lot of wax..."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P990675627" "I knew it!<t 2>You weezers are responsible for this, aren't you!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3764224822" "Taskmaster Carlyle"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4144682482" "If we don't move these souls the big boss is going to be furious."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3185052573" "Stop the outsider!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1592126463" "Unthinkable!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3688849876" "Ah! The nerve of you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
