"P54850571" "H... Help me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2074210866" "Your sssacrifice will not go unrewarded, sssister."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2780555653" "You die today, but will be reborn in the Netherworld."
// Script Variable PET_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P90512518" "I see... Darkness."
