"P1877505759" "Push them from my mind?!<t 3>They are what fuels me, slave.<t 3>Now, bow before your master!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P451714783" "And so does {HeroName}.<t 2>Will you stand with me, or fall with Montague and these weaklings?<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3521956339" "So be it, {HeroName}!<t 3>Prepare to die!<t 0.1>"
